@ pokeemerald data/maps/FortreeCity/scripts.inc: FortreeCity_Text_SawGiganticPokemonInSky
Hoenn_FortreeCity_Text_SawGiganticPokemonInSky::
	.string "No one believes me, but I saw this\n"
	.string "gigantic POKéMON in the sky.\p"
	.string "It seemed to squirm as it flew toward\n"
	.string "ROUTE 131.\p"
	.string "By the way… Sniff…\n"
	.string "Um… You, uh…smell singed.\p"
	.string "Were you at a volcano or something?$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/FortreeCity/scripts.inc: FortreeCity_Text_TreesGrowByDrinkingRainwater
Hoenn_FortreeCity_Text_TreesGrowByDrinkingRainwater::
	.string "The ground absorbs rainwater, and\n"
	.string "trees grow by drinking that water…\p"
	.string "Our FORTREE CITY exists because\n"
	.string "there's both water and soil.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/FortreeCity/scripts.inc: FortreeCity_Text_ThisTimeIllBeatWinona
Hoenn_FortreeCity_Text_ThisTimeIllBeatWinona::
	.string "I've got my pride-and-joy POKéMON\n"
	.string "with me. This time, I'll beat WINONA.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/FortreeCity/scripts.inc: FortreeCity_Text_BugPokemonComeThroughWindow
Hoenn_FortreeCity_Text_BugPokemonComeThroughWindow::
	.string "Living on top of trees is okay.\p"
	.string "But sometimes BUG POKéMON come in\n"
	.string "through windows.\l"
	.string "It can be really startling.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/FortreeCity/scripts.inc: FortreeCity_Text_EveryoneHealthyAndLively
Hoenn_FortreeCity_Text_EveryoneHealthyAndLively::
	.string "The CITY consists of homes built on\n"
	.string "trees.\p"
	.string "Perhaps because of that lifestyle,\n"
	.string "everyone is healthy and lively.\p"
	.string "Why, even myself--I feel as if I've\n"
	.string "grown thirty years younger.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/FortreeCity/scripts.inc: FortreeCity_Text_PokemonThatEvolveWhenTraded
Hoenn_FortreeCity_Text_PokemonThatEvolveWhenTraded::
	.string "There are POKéMON that evolve when\n"
	.string "you trade them! That's what I heard.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/FortreeCity/scripts.inc: FortreeCity_Text_CitySign
Hoenn_FortreeCity_Text_CitySign::
	.string "FORTREE CITY\n"
	.string "“The treetop city that frolics with\l"
	.string "nature.”$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/FortreeCity/scripts.inc: FortreeCity_Text_GymSign
Hoenn_FortreeCity_Text_GymSign::
